ands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}